{"id":"wb-5-516","name":"南风古灶、高灶陶窑","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南风古灶、高灶陶窑","text":"南风古灶是一个位于广东省佛山市禅城区石湾镇街道高庙路的窑，始建于1506年，明朝正德年间，至今已有超过500年的历史。对研究中国的陶瓷生产技术的发展具有重要的价值。\n南风古灶是全国重点文物保护单位、国家AAAA级旅游景区、佛山新八景之一，并载入吉尼斯世界纪录。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E9%A3%8E%E5%8F%A4%E7%81%B6%E3%80%81%E9%AB%98%E7%81%B6%E9%99%B6%E7%AA%91","revisionId":92314920,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92314920","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/915d5dd9f1061743c3c47cd4.jpg","title":"南风古灶、高灶陶窑全貌.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8D%97%E9%A3%8E%E5%8F%A4%E7%81%B6%E3%80%81%E9%AB%98%E7%81%B6%E9%99%B6%E7%AA%91%E5%85%A8%E8%B2%8C.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/%E5%8D%97%E9%A3%8E%E5%8F%A4%E7%81%B6%E3%80%81%E9%AB%98%E7%81%B6%E9%99%B6%E7%AA%91%E5%85%A8%E8%B2%8C.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Pkkj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Nanfeng Kiln and Gaozao Kiln in Foshan, Guangdong","width":320,"height":213}}